# D23 (LOAD-BEARING, invariant #8): a `throws` call as a BARE STATEMENT
# (discarded), in a non-propagating context. Pre-D23 this SILENTLY SWALLOWED the
# error (no diagnostic; ran and printed "done"). Now it must REJECT with
# E_UnhandledThrows.
int risky() throws String:
    throw "boom"

void main():
    risky()
    print("done")
